# VS Code REST Client. Set process AIWM_API_TOKEN to the local operator token.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@apiToken = {{$processEnv AIWM_API_TOKEN}}

### Health
GET {{base}}/healthz

### Inventory
GET {{base}}/api/v1/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### External containers (read-only)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/containers?origin=LEGACY
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Create a managed whole-GPU job
# @name create
POST {{base}}/api/v1/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ../requests/create-job.json

### Job detail
GET {{base}}/api/v1/jobs/{{create.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Stop/cancel only the job created above
POST {{base}}/api/v1/jobs/{{create.response.body.data.id}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Queue
GET {{base}}/api/v1/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}

### Scheduler (optional; it also runs automatically)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/scheduler/run-once
Authorization: Bearer {{apiToken}}
